# Every way a check can fail to RESOLVE, which is a different thing from failing.
size 40x30
Background transparent
name a
Poly (0.10,0.10) (0.30,0.10) (0.30,0.30) (0.10,0.30) rgb=200,10,10
name ghost
landmark mid = 0.5
check ghost.cx ~ 0.5
check nobody.cx ~ 0.5
check a.middle ~ 0.5
check somewhere ~ 0.5
check a.cx
check a.cx ~ what
check a.cx ~ mid + oops
check a.cx ~ 0.5 tol
